      "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/b8da710876a5378e07a43aaf7ade4386.poster.avif?t=1763559351\" width=596 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/b8da710876a5378e07a43aaf7ade4386.webm?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/b8da710876a5378e07a43aaf7ade4386.mp4?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Beat Slayer is a roguelite hack n’ slay game like no other. Instead of just being in the background the music takes centre stage.<br>Join Mia, a badass music lover and crafty tinkerer, as she battles hordes of robots in a dystopian 90s-inspired Berlin. There’s only one rule:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/11fa9b115e2806996373e4594e2ad112.poster.avif?t=1763559351\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/11fa9b115e2806996373e4594e2ad112.webm?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/11fa9b115e2806996373e4594e2ad112.mp4?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight to the rhythm!</h2>Every move you make has to match the rhythm of the soundtrack. Fail to do so and you’ll pay the price. No button mashing, no frantic inputs. Only smooth and skillful gameplay will lead to your victory against the waves of different enemies and imposing bosses!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Show them your moves!</h2>Leverage Mia’s nimble move set and decide within seconds which of your moves you should use. Dash to engage or disengage? Attack to build up your drive bar or spread your status effects? Kick your enemies against walls or into each other? The choice is yours!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay it your way!</h2>Each run plays differently and is influenced by your playstyle and your thrill for risks, but also by your starting weapon, your chosen upgrades and your growing skill set.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/09ec86f20fe3a1cc5bfbc26940ca3ff4.poster.avif?t=1763559351\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/09ec86f20fe3a1cc5bfbc26940ca3ff4.webm?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/09ec86f20fe3a1cc5bfbc26940ca3ff4.mp4?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Berlin Attitude</h2>Rely on your unconventional team of rebels as you navigate through a robot-controlled and corrupted Berlin. Discover the city's diverse locations, from underground bunkers to towering rooftops, while your allies assist with weapons, upgrades, and valuable insights.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get in the flow!</h2>Put on your headphones, sync with the beat and dive more and more into the action to enter the “flow state”. Don’t think and just play. Let the music guide you and create your own symphony of destruction round, after round, after round!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/47e4f7d14e0223aeacf2229e47c9d383.avif?t=1763559351\" width=523 height=186 /></span>",
      "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/b8da710876a5378e07a43aaf7ade4386.poster.avif?t=1763559351\" width=596 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/b8da710876a5378e07a43aaf7ade4386.webm?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/b8da710876a5378e07a43aaf7ade4386.mp4?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Beat Slayer is a roguelite hack n’ slay game like no other. Instead of just being in the background the music takes centre stage.<br>Join Mia, a badass music lover and crafty tinkerer, as she battles hordes of robots in a dystopian 90s-inspired Berlin. There’s only one rule:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/11fa9b115e2806996373e4594e2ad112.poster.avif?t=1763559351\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/11fa9b115e2806996373e4594e2ad112.webm?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/11fa9b115e2806996373e4594e2ad112.mp4?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight to the rhythm!</h2>Every move you make has to match the rhythm of the soundtrack. Fail to do so and you’ll pay the price. No button mashing, no frantic inputs. Only smooth and skillful gameplay will lead to your victory against the waves of different enemies and imposing bosses!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Show them your moves!</h2>Leverage Mia’s nimble move set and decide within seconds which of your moves you should use. Dash to engage or disengage? Attack to build up your drive bar or spread your status effects? Kick your enemies against walls or into each other? The choice is yours!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay it your way!</h2>Each run plays differently and is influenced by your playstyle and your thrill for risks, but also by your starting weapon, your chosen upgrades and your growing skill set.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/09ec86f20fe3a1cc5bfbc26940ca3ff4.poster.avif?t=1763559351\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/09ec86f20fe3a1cc5bfbc26940ca3ff4.webm?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/09ec86f20fe3a1cc5bfbc26940ca3ff4.mp4?t=1763559351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Berlin Attitude</h2>Rely on your unconventional team of rebels as you navigate through a robot-controlled and corrupted Berlin. Discover the city's diverse locations, from underground bunkers to towering rooftops, while your allies assist with weapons, upgrades, and valuable insights.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get in the flow!</h2>Put on your headphones, sync with the beat and dive more and more into the action to enter the “flow state”. Don’t think and just play. Let the music guide you and create your own symphony of destruction round, after round, after round!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089830/extras/47e4f7d14e0223aeacf2229e47c9d383.avif?t=1763559351\" width=523 height=186 /></span>",
      "short_description": "Beat Slayer is a roguelite hack n’ slay game like no other. Instead of just being in the background the music takes centre stage. Join Mia, a badass music lover and crafty tinkerer, as she battles hordes of robots in a dystopian 90s inspired Berlin. There’s only one rule: Stay on beat!",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
      "reviews": "“Beat Slayer is Hades meets Hi-Fi Rush and it lives up to its name of slaying some brilliant tunes. A superb art direction blended with intense, frenetic rogue-like action and a pumping techno soundtrack make this a mixtape worth digging out the headphones for. It’s not a perfect record, owing to a lighter story and the odd combat quirk, but it’s one worth having in the collection.”<br>8/10 – Fingerguns<br>",
